# Store text with LF line endings in the repository and check it out with LF
# everywhere, whatever core.autocrlf says. Fixes CRLF churn and the eslint
# line-ending noise on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never convert line endings in binary files. Git's text detection classed
# the PDF fixtures as text, so core.autocrlf rewrote them on Windows
# checkouts and broke the golden checksum tests.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
